Lion's Roar	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Sonic	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:120 ft.	TARGETAREA:120-ft.-radius burst centered on you	DURATION:Instantaneous or (CASTERLEVEL) minutes	SAVEINFO:Fortitude partial or Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes or Yes (harmless); see text	DOMAINS:Courage=8	DESC:Deals ((CASTERLEVEL+1)/2)d8 to enemies; allies get +1 on attack and saves against fear, plus temporary hp.|!PRERULE:1,DisplayFullSpell	SOURCELONG:Complete Warrior	SOURCESHORT:CW	SOURCEPAGE:p.118	SOURCEDATE:2003-12
